<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Media Pembelajaran Mesin Bubut - SMK N 5 Medan</title>

    <!-- Fonts & Icons -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,400;14..32,500;14..32,600;14..32,700;14..32,800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        /* =============================================================
           GLOBAL STYLES (digunakan semua halaman)
           ============================================================= */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: #f0f4fb;
            color: #1a2639;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* ---------- NAVBAR (bersama) ---------- */
        .navbar {
            background: #0b1a2e;
            padding: 0 24px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2a4b6e;
        }
        .navbar .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            padding: 12px 0;
        }
        .navbar .logo i {
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }
        .navbar .logo span {
            color: #94b8d9;
            font-weight: 400;
        }
        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 4px;
            padding: 8px 0;
        }
        .nav-links button {
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: #b0c9e0;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }
        .nav-links button i {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .nav-links button:hover {
            background: #1a334d;
            color: #fff;
        }
        .nav-links button.active {
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
        }
        @media (max-width: 780px) {
            .navbar {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
                padding: 0 12px;
            }
            .nav-links {
                justify-content: center;
                padding-bottom: 10px;
            }
            .nav-links button {
                font-size: 0.7rem;
                padding: 6px 12px;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            .nav-links button {
                font-size: 0.6rem;
                padding: 4px 8px;
            }
            .nav-links button i {
                display: none;
            }
        }

        /* ---------- MAIN CONTENT (bersama) ---------- */
        .main-content {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 1280px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 30px 24px 40px;
        }
        .page {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease;
        }
        .page.active {
            display: block;
        }
        @keyframes fadeUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(16px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }
        .page-title {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0b1a2e;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .page-title i {
            color: #2563eb;
        }
        .page-sub {
            color: #475569;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
            padding-left: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 24px 0 10px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        /* =============================================================
           START: STYLE PER MENU (masing-masing diberi prefix #id)
           ============================================================= */

        /* ---------- BERANDA (#beranda) ---------- */
        #beranda .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b1a2e 0%, #1a3a5a 100%);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 40px 40px 50px;
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(11, 26, 46, 0.25);
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        #beranda .hero::after {
            content: "⚙️";
            position: absolute;
            right: -20px;
            bottom: -40px;
            font-size: 180px;
            opacity: 0.06;
            transform: rotate(-15deg);
        }
        #beranda .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.6rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        #beranda .hero h1 span {
            color: #60a5fa;
        }
        #beranda .hero p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin: 14px 0 22px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        #beranda .badge {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
            padding: 6px 18px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }
        #beranda .badge i {
            color: #fbbf24;
        }
        #beranda .stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        #beranda .stat-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        }
        #beranda .stat-card .num {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #60a5fa;
        }
        #beranda .stat-card .label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        #beranda .grid-info {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
        #beranda .grid-info .box {
            background: #eef2f6;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        #beranda .grid-info .box i {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #2563eb;
        }
        #beranda .grid-info .box h4 {
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        #beranda .grid-info .box p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #475569;
        }

        /* ---------- MATERI (#materi) ---------- */
        #materi .materi-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }
        #materi .materi-card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            border-left: 6px solid #2563eb;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        #materi .materi-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
        }
        #materi .materi-card h3 {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #0b1a2e;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        #materi .materi-card h3 i {
            color: #2563eb;
            width: 24px;
        }
        #materi .materi-card p {
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        #materi .materi-card ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        /* ---------- VIDEO (#video) ---------- */
        #video .video-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 28px;
        }
        #video .video-item {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        #video .video-item iframe {
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 16/9;
            border: none;
        }
        #video .video-item .info {
            padding: 16px 20px;
        }
        #video .video-item .info h4 {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #0b1a2e;
        }
        #video .video-item .info p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        /* ---------- SIMULASI (#simulasi) ---------- */
        #simulasi .sim-container {
            background: #0b0e14;
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            position: relative;
        }
        #simulasi #sim3d-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 600px;
            display: block;
            background: #121820;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-overlay-info {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-overlay-info i {
            color: #60a5fa;
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-controls-bar {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px 30px;
            background: #1a2639;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            border-radius: 0 0 24px 24px;
            align-items: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #2a3a4e;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-controls-bar label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            color: #b0c9e0;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-controls-bar input[type="range"] {
            width: 140px;
            accent-color: #2563eb;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-controls-bar .val {
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700;
            min-width: 48px;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-controls-bar .btn-sim {
            background: #2563eb;
            border: none;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 8px 22px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-controls-bar .btn-sim:hover {
            background: #3b82f6;
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }
        #simulasi .sim-controls-bar .btn-sim.danger {
            background: #b91c1c;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-controls-bar .btn-sim.danger:hover {
            background: #dc2626;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-controls-bar .btn-sim.outline {
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #4a5a6a;
            color: #b0c9e0;
        }
        #simulasi .sim-controls-bar .btn-sim.outline:hover {
            background: #2a3a4e;
        }

        /* ---------- KUIS (#kuis) ---------- */
        #kuis .quiz-box {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px 28px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }
        #kuis .quiz-box .q {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        #kuis .quiz-box .q span {
            color: #2563eb;
        }
        #kuis .quiz-box label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 8px 0;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding-left: 12px;
            transition: 0.1s;
        }
        #kuis .quiz-box label:hover {
            background: #f0f4fb;
        }
        #kuis .quiz-box input[type="radio"] {
            accent-color: #2563eb;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
        }
        #kuis .btn-submit {
            background: #0b1a2e;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 40px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        #kuis .btn-submit:hover {
            background: #1a334d;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        #kuis .score-result {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            background: #f0f4fb;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        /* ---------- EVALUASI (#evaluasi) ---------- */
        #evaluasi .eval-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 30px;
        }
        #evaluasi .eval-wrapper .section-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            background: #eef2f6;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        #evaluasi .eval-wrapper .section-title i {
            color: #2563eb;
        }
        #evaluasi .quiz-box {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px 28px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }
        #evaluasi .quiz-box .q {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        #evaluasi .quiz-box .q span {
            color: #2563eb;
        }
        #evaluasi .quiz-box label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 8px 0;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding-left: 12px;
        }
        #evaluasi .quiz-box label:hover {
            background: #f0f4fb;
        }
        #evaluasi .quiz-box input[type="radio"] {
            accent-color: #2563eb;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
        }
        #evaluasi .btn-submit {
            background: #0b1a2e;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 40px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        #evaluasi .btn-submit:hover {
            background: #1a334d;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        #evaluasi .score-result {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            background: #f0f4fb;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        @media (max-width: 780px) {
            #evaluasi .eval-wrapper {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        /* ---------- PROFIL (#profil) ---------- */
        #profil .profil-card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            max-width: 700px;
        }
        #profil .profil-card .avatar {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background: #2563eb;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        #profil .profil-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }
        #profil .profil-card .detail {
            color: #475569;
            margin: 6px 0 14px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        #profil .profil-card .detail i {
            width: 28px;
            color: #2563eb;
        }
        #profil .profil-card .badge-profil {
            background: #eef2f6;
            padding: 4px 14px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1a334d;
        }
        #profil .profil-card ul {
            margin-top: 14px;
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 2;
        }
        #profil .profil-card .quote {
            background: #f0f4fb;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        #profil .profil-card .quote i {
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        /* responsive umum */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            #beranda .hero h1 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            .page-title {
                font-size: 1.4rem;
            }
            #simulasi .sim-controls-bar {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
            }
            #simulasi .sim-controls-bar label {
                justify-content: space-between;
            }
            #simulasi #sim3d-container {
                height: 340px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ============================================================
    NAVBAR (bersama)
    ============================================================ -->
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="logo">
            <i class="fas fa-cogs"></i>
            <span>SMK N 5 Medan</span> · Bubut
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
            <button class="active" data-page="beranda"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Beranda</button>
            <button data-page="materi"><i class="fas fa-book"></i> Materi</button>
            <button data-page="video"><i class="fas fa-play-circle"></i> Video</button>
            <button data-page="simulasi"><i class="fas fa-cubes"></i> Simulasi</button>
            <button data-page="kuis"><i class="fas fa-puzzle-piece"></i> Kuis</button>
            <button data-page="evaluasi"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check"></i> Evaluasi</button>
            <button data-page="profil"><i class="fas fa-user-graduate"></i> Profil</button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ============================================================
    MAIN CONTENT
    ============================================================ -->
    <div class="main-content">

        <!-- ==========================================================
        MENU 1 : BERANDA
        ========================================================== -->
        <div id="beranda" class="page active">
            <div class="hero">
                <div class="badge"><i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i> Kelas X Teknik Pemesinan</div>
                <h1>Media Pembelajaran <br><span>Mesin Bubut</span> Interaktif</h1>
                <p>Selamat datang di portal pembelajaran berbasis web untuk meningkatkan kompetensi praktik dan teori mesin bubut. Dilengkapi simulasi 3D, video, dan evaluasi mandiri.</p>
                <div class="stats">
                    <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">7</div><div class="label">Modul Pembelajaran</div></div>
                    <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">3D</div><div class="label">Simulasi Realistis</div></div>
                    <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">20+</div><div class="label">Soal Latihan</div></div>
                    <div class="stat-card"><div class="num">✔</div><div class="label">Evaluasi Pretest/Posttest</div></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-info">
                <div class="box">
                    <i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i>
                    <h4>Tujuan</h4>
                    <p>Meningkatkan pemahaman komponen, fungsi, dan proses pembubutan secara mandiri.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="box">
                    <i class="fas fa-clock"></i>
                    <h4>Waktu Belajar</h4>
                    <p>Sesuaikan kecepatan belajar Anda. Kuis dan evaluasi untuk mengukur progres.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ==========================================================
        MENU 2 : MATERI
        ========================================================== -->
        <div id="materi" class="page">
            <h2 class="page-title"><i class="fas fa-book-open"></i> Materi Mesin Bubut</h2>
            <p class="page-sub">Pelajari komponen, prinsip kerja, dan teknik dasar pembubutan.</p>
            <div class="materi-grid">
                <div class="materi-card">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-cog"></i> Definisi</h3>
                    <p>Mesin bubut adalah mesin perkakas yang memutar benda kerja pada sumbu putar (spindle) untuk melakukan proses pemotongan, pembentukan, dan finishing menggunakan pahat.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="materi-card">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-microchip"></i> Bagian Utama</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><b>Kepala Tetap</b> : Tempat spindle & pengatur RPM.</li>
                        <li><b>Kepala Lepas</b> : Penyangga benda kerja panjang.</li>
                        <li><b>Eretan (Carriage)</b> : Membawa pahat bergerak memanjang/melintang.</li>
                        <li><b>Alas (Bed)</b> : Rangka dasar mesin.</li>
                        <li><b>Chuck</b> : Penjepit benda kerja.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="materi-card">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-arrows-spin"></i> Prinsip Kerja</h3>
                    <p>Benda kerja dicekam dan diputar oleh spindle. Pahat didekatkan ke permukaan benda dengan kedalaman tertentu (depth of cut). Gerakan pahat secara axial menghasilkan bentuk silinder, sedangkan gerakan radial menghasilkan bentuk permukaan.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="materi-card">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-ruler"></i> Parameter Penting</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><b>Kecepatan Putar (RPM)</b> : Mempengaruhi kekasaran permukaan.</li>
                        <li><b>Kecepatan Pemakanan (Feed)</b> : Gerakan pahat per putaran.</li>
                        <li><b>Kedalaman Potong (DOC)</b> : Tebal sayatan, mempengaruhi umur pahat.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="materi-card">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-hammer"></i> Jenis Pahat</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Pahat Rata (Turning Tool)</li>
                        <li>Pahat Alur (Grooving Tool)</li>
                        <li>Pahat Ulir (Threading Tool)</li>
                        <li>Pahat Potong (Parting Tool)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="materi-card">
                    <h3><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> K3 (Keselamatan)</h3>
                    <ul>
